OL,3,AGPs, police and pharmacies among UK
OL,4,Aservices affected by Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FGPs, police and pharmacies are among UK
OL,7,Fservices affected by a global outage on
OL,8,Fsome Microsoft platforms.
OL,10,FNHS England said patients should still
OL,11,Fattend appointments unless told
OL,12,Fotherwise, while several large police
OL,13,Fforces are urging members of the public
OL,14,Fto call if they want to make a report.
OL,15,FMPs have also been affected.
OL,17,FMicrosoft has said the problem was
OL,18,Fcaused by a higher-than-usual stress on
OL,19,Fits servers but that systems were now
OL,20,Fshowing "early signs of stabilisation"
OL,21,Fas work continued on a fix.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
